# DTF tier manifest: composer-virtual-packagist-member  (artifact-keeper#4951)
# Profile-set: filesystem + upstreams.mock-scan-formats (its Packagist-shaped
# Composer upstream: p2/<vendor>/<pkg>.json whose dist.url points at a
# separate /composer/zipball/<pkg>.zip endpoint) + client.composer (a real
# Composer 2 client on the DTF network only, so it can reach the backend but
# not the mock).
#
# #4951: a Composer Virtual over a non-scanning Remote member pointing at a
# Packagist-style upstream answered 404 for the dist the Remote serves, because
# the virtual walk synthesized dist/<vendor>/<pkg>/<version>/<ref>.zip against
# the member's upstream base. The virtual p2 metadata also passed the member's
# dist.url through verbatim, so clients bypassed the Virtual entirely.
#
# Red on 1.11.7 (and 1.12.0 main before the fix); green with the fix.
PROFILES="storage.filesystem upstreams.mock-scan-formats client.composer"
ORACLE="oracle.sh"
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED="false"
UPSTREAM_ALLOW_PRIVATE_IPS="true"
